<title>HONG KONG: Min XIn raises HK$162 mln thru warrants.</title>
<headline>Min XIn raises HK$162 mln thru warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chinese investment company Min Xin Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it had raised HK$162 million on its 59.4 million warrants, expired on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The group said they were 95 percent subscribed for a total of 56.4 million shares of the company.</p>
<p>The company's enlarged share capital now amounts to 359,193,456 shares, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
